    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαιτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαιτέω</span>
			, <i>demand back,</i> of things forcibly taken away, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.78
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				178
			</span></i>; simply, <i>demand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					42.382
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.443
			</span></i>.</div>
